WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.800
What do you want to learn?

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:07.480
Guitar. SQL. Japanese. Chess. Anything. Really.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:10.110
Tell Duolify the topic,

00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:12.500
your level, and how many minutes a day.

00:00:12.810 --> 00:00:16.310
In minutes, AI builds a course made just for you.

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:21.890
Lessons are short, interactive videos,

00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:23.970
with characters who talk you through it.

00:00:24.210 --> 00:00:26.980
Stuck? Circle it, and ask out loud.

00:00:27.230 --> 00:00:28.660
Want to remember something?

00:00:28.690 --> 00:00:30.420
Hold to save a voice note.

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:38.490
Streaks, XP, and friend streaks keep you coming back.

00:00:38.620 --> 00:00:40.620
Every lesson is a small win.

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:46.050
Create your own characters.

00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:48.180
Then share your course with anyone,

00:00:48.210 --> 00:00:49.480
with just a link.

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:54.930
Duolify.

00:00:54.960 --> 00:00:56.780
Learn anything, like a game.
